data: {"id": "ddc8ac6c97914cb3-thinking-parallel_evidence-1697", "run_id": "ddc8ac6c97914cb3", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实与冲突分析\n\n### ✅ 核心证据（EP1 - Pod YAML）\n\n| 字段 | 值 | 含义 |\n|---|---|---|\n| **deletionTimestamp** | `2026-09-14T06:34:09Z` | ✅ 已存在，Pod 已被请求删除 |\n| **finalizers** | `<none>` | ❌ **无 finalizer**，排除 finalizer 卡死 |\n| **terminationGracePeriodSeconds** | `3900` (65分钟) | ⚠️ 极长的宽限期 |\n| **lifecycle.preStop** | 有，等待 `/state/teardown-requested` | ⚠️ **PreStop hook 会阻塞直到该文件出现** |\n| **pod.spec.command** | `while not Path('/state/teardown-requested').exists(): sleep(0.2)` | ⚠️ **容器主进程同样等待该文件** |\n| **phase** | `", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789363829455, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

